    Buff Duty's Buff Key (Features/Buff-Window-Keys.lua). It clicks a hidden
    secure button, which picks the next buff on the list and casts it.
    A macro clicks the same button: /click TFTBBuffIndividual.
    The client loads this file on its own; it is not listed in the TOCs.
-->
<Bindings>
	<Binding name="CLICK TFTBBuffIndividual:LeftButton" header="TFTB" category="ADDONS" />
</Bindings>
